OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't want to go into hedgehog
OL,4,Amode at 4pm this winter'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm dreading this next weekend because
OL,7,Fthe clocks are going back and it will
OL,8,Fbe very difficult," says 73-year-old
OL,9,FJenny Barrie - one of the people to
OL,10,Floan a "Wintering Well" box from
OL,11,FHarrogate Library in a bid to help her
OL,12,Fthrough the coming winter months.
OL,14,FAs we all prepare for the clocks to go
OL,15,Fback an hour this weekend, Jenny says
OL,16,Fthe darkness of the season often causes
OL,17,Fher to feel down and lose motivation,
OL,18,Fbut with the help of the contents of
OL,19,Fthe box, she says she hopes this year
OL,20,Fwill be different and she can beat the
OL,21,Fwinter blues.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
