OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't want to go into hedgehog
OL,4,Amode at 4pm this winter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHers is one of 150 free kits library
OL,7,Fusers will be able to borrow in North
OL,8,FYorkshire following the clock change,
OL,9,Fwith each box including a therapeutic
OL,10,Flight lamp, a guidebook with tips on
OL,11,Fcreating a new winter routine and a
OL,12,Ffree online course helping users tackle
OL,13,Fthe effects of seasonal affective
OL,14,Fdisorder (SAD).
OL,16,F"I've never been diagnosed with it
OL,17,F[SAD], but I'm convinced I am affected
OL,18,Fby it because I feel instantly down in
OL,19,Fthe winter as soon as the dark nights
OL,20,Fcome," Jenny explains.
